Qt 6
----
https://www.qt.io/
LGPLv3 (Qt Core, Qt Gui, Qt Qml, Qt Quick, Qt Quick Controls, Qt Network).

Linked dynamically and shipped as separate, replaceable libraries inside the
.app bundle and the AppImage. The LGPLv3 and GPLv3 texts (LGPL-3.0.txt and
GPL-3.0.txt) ship with this file: in Contents/Resources/licenses of the .app,
in usr/share/licenses/roost of the AppImage.
Qt sources: https://download.qt.io/official_releases/qt/ for the version named
in the release notes. No GPL-only Qt module is linked.


